        title: "Definition of “Myth”",
        printedIn: "Walter Hooper, “Past Watchful Dragons: The Fairy Tales of C.S. Lewis,” <i>Imagination and the Spirit,</i> ed. Charles A. Huttar (Grand Rapids: Eerdmans)",
